WEBVTT - AirGuard Interactive Walkthrough Subtitles

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.858
Welcome to AirGuard, an IoT-based hyperlocal air quality monitoring and intelligent alert system.

2
00:00:06.858 --> 00:00:15.001
AirGuard delivers street-level detection, capturing micro-climate pollution spikes using ESP32 edge hardware.

3
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:22.659
The platform integrates nine core engineering modules, from live telemetry to automated compliance audits.

4
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:30.087
Built on a five-layer pipeline, connecting hardware sensors through an Express gateway to MongoDB Atlas.

5
00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:39.625
For research, sensor calibration, or deployment assistance, contact our team directly at airguard396@gmail.com.

6
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:46.398
An interactive one-click button lets you instantly copy the engineering mailbox with verified feedback.

7
00:00:46.398 --> 00:00:55.965
Entering the live dashboard, you see a real-time 0 to 500 EPA circular air quality index gauge with instant sub-second telemetry.

8
00:00:55.965 --> 00:01:05.468
Comprehensive atmospheric forecasting provides a 24-hour timeline, 7-day weather outlook, wind vectors, and UV index.

9
00:01:05.468 --> 00:01:11.976
Seamless one-click switching between ultra-premium frosted daylight and obsidian dark presets.

10
00:01:11.976 --> 00:01:19.179
The hardware registry tracks multi-node IoT sensor heartbeats, battery health, and packet telemetry.

11
00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:26.698
Spatial micro-zones cluster sensors by campus laboratories, roadways, and sensitive outdoor areas.

12
00:01:26.698 --> 00:01:34.400
Server-side analytics calculate mathematical correlations between temperature, humidity, and pollutant spikes.

13
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:41.644
Smart alerts prevent alarm fatigue with 30-minute deduplication, providing clear health advisories.

14
00:01:41.644 --> 00:01:48.192
Regulatory audit reports track EPA and national standards with one-click CSV export.

15
00:01:48.192 --> 00:01:56.785
AirGuard: Understand your air, protect your environment. Live at airguard-hyperlocal.vercel.app.

